The Jayesh Yadav resume fixtures were supplied in the user's workspace and are
included as requested for regression testing; this project's Apache license does
not grant additional rights to the personal documents.

The local_api package is a new HTTP adapter implemented for this repository.
It calls the unmodified authoritative Unstructured source checkout directly.
No existing local_api implementation was present in that source checkout.

